{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103550","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103550","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710355001:0":{"text":"……コルネリウス卿？あら、ウサルス卿も一緒なのね。","source_cn":"……是康拉德大法官吗？哦，还有……乌瑟斯子爵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC230110B63863EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710355002:0":{"text":"ペギー殿下！ああ、デューラ様に感謝。あなた様がご無事で良かった！","source_cn":"公主殿下！艾雅保佑，能平安见到您真是荣幸之至。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEEDC4C1C6B84A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710355003:0":{"text":"ごきげんよう、殿下。","source_cn":"公主殿下，日安。<key:dialog5>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E2F07124F7E8E98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710355004:0":{"text":"殿下がここにいらっしゃるということは、私の推測は正しかったということですな。ここは古聖堂の中で間違いないようじゃ。","source_cn":"既然您也出现在这里，那么老夫的推论就成立了——我们确实...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5D851419674F5D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710355005:0":{"text":"殿下、無礼を承知で申し上げますが……この件は、とても偶然とは思えませんな。","source_cn":"恕我直言，公主殿下。这件事发生得太过……巧合了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44C0275C5FAFEBF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","documen