"document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710355011:0":{"text":"大法官、あなた、私を尋問しているの？","source_cn":"大法官阁下，您是在审问我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x654797F6DA7EFEDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710355012:0":{"text":"どうしてこうなったのか、私にも分からないし、何も変なことはしてないわよ！","source_cn":"我对此事一无所知，也没有做错任何事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C5825E33AE3DBF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710355013:1":{"text":"ですが、規定通りなら……","source_cn":"但根据程序——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x635DC5FDBC93D20E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710355014:1":{"text":"しーっ！お二人とも、お静かに！見回りの鎧に気付かれたら、一巻の終わりですよ！","source_cn":"嘘！嘘——！二位，请稍安勿躁！要是把那些巡逻的盔甲引过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2325A8CD6E5FF88B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710355015:0":{"text":"大法官殿、状況もはっきりしない今、仲間内で揉めるのはよくないかと……","source_cn":"大法官，现在局势未明，我们可不能内部先乱了阵脚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1791C6D72830168C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710355016:1":{"text":"副大臣殿、私は規定に沿った質問をしているだけじゃよ。","source_cn":"副大臣，老夫这是在进行必要的质询。",