.","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CB9F713BFA53534","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710355022:1":{"text":"ええ、分かっているわ。今はここから出る方法を探すのが先だわ。","source_cn":"乌瑟斯卿说的没错，现在的首要任务是离开圣古堂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA961B5F9035F17A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1710355023:1":{"text":"古聖堂には、王族しか知らない<style=\"highlight\">秘密の抜け道</style>があるの。けど、大法官がまだ規定に拘るようなら……","source_cn":"我知道一条只有王室成员才知晓的、离开圣古堂的<styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DABB6DBFF207A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710355024:0":{"text":"大法官殿、聞きましたか？ひとまず他のことは置いておいて、殿下のご指示に従いましょう。","source_cn":"大法官阁下，有这样一条生路，不如暂且放下成见，听从殿下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE02FC05C61D40DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710355025:0":{"text":"……そうじゃな。命の危機を前にしては、真相解明はひとまず後回しにするしかなかろう。","source_cn":"……好吧。在生存危机面前，调查真相可以暂时延后。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD318FA5429E4A747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710355026:0":{"text":"ですが、殿下。ここを出た後は、私だけでなく民にも、納得のいく説明をしていただきますぞ。","source_cn":"但请记住，事后，无论是老